{
  "note": "Synthetic. Shape follows the Connect-RPC billing reply the kimi.com code console calls: usages[] keyed by scope, detail carrying limit/used/remaining as strings beside an ISO resetTime, and limits[] carrying rate windows identified by window.duration and window.timeUnit. The vendor publishes no schema for it; the shape is read from the implementation of the tool this app is measured against, and the note on the harness says so and when. Every figure here is invented, and the plan sizes are not evidence of any real tier.",
